<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's CTC upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's CTC upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has upgraded its rating for Compania Telecomunicaciones de Chile SA to outperform from neutral, a source at the firm said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- American Depositary Receipts in CTC opened up 1/8 to 29-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
